    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pav bhaji serves 4 and takes about 50 minutes. Boil and mash the vegetables well so the bhaji is smooth. Use plenty of butter, as it is what makes this dish special."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Mash the vegetables right in the pan as they cook for the best texture."
          }
        ]
      },
